<h1 class="doc-h1">Tabs</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A compiler, and one decision worth knowing: an inactive panel is <code>hidden</code> rather
    than removed, so the fields inside it still post. A tab strip that empties the form when you
    look at another tab is a bug people spend a long time not finding.
</p>

